-- title:
--   Bound for inflation images in H¹ at a tame level
-- statement:
--   Let $k$ be a field, $G$ a group, $M$ a finite-dimensional $k$-linear representation of $G$ with action $\rho$, and $\chi\colon G\to k^\times$ a homomorphism. Let $U,W,I$ be normal subgroups of $G$ with $U$ and $W$ of finite index, such that $\rho(u)=1$ for all $u\in U$ and $U\le W$. Let $q$ be a prime that is nonzero in $k$, and assume every $w\in W$ satisfies $w^{q^{a}}\in U$ for some $a\in\mathbb{N}$. Let $t\in I$ be such that every $i\in I$ lies in $t^{a}W$ for some $a\in\mathbb{N}$, and let $\varphi\in G$ be such that every $g\in G$ lies in $\varphi^{n}(I\sqcup U)$ for some $n\in\mathbb{N}$, where $I\sqcup U$ denotes the subgroup generated by $I$ and $U$. Assume $\chi$ is trivial on $I$ and on $U$, that $\chi(\varphi)=q$ in $k$, and that $m\in\mathbb{N}$ satisfies $mq=1$ in $k$; assume further that in $G/W$ one has $\bar\varphi^{-1}\bar t\bar\varphi=\bar t^{\,m}$ and $\bar\varphi\bar t\bar\varphi^{-1}\in\langle\bar t\rangle$. Then the $k$-dimension of the image of the inflation map $H^1(G/U, M^U) \to H^1(G,M)$, induced by the projection $G\to G/U$ together with the inclusion of the $U$-invariants, is at most $\dim_k M^{G}+\dim_k (M^{\vee}\otimes\chi)^{G}$, where $M^{\vee}\otimes\chi$ is the dual representation of $M$ with $g$ acting by $\chi(g)\cdot\rho^{\vee}(g)$.
--
--   This is a local Euler-characteristic style upper bound, in the shape of a finite quotient of a local Galois group at a residue characteristic $q$ different from the coefficient characteristic: $U$ plays the role of the subgroup cutting out a finite level, $W$ of wild inertia, $I$ of inertia with tame generator $t$, $\varphi$ of a Frobenius lift, and $\chi$ of the cyclotomic character. It feeds the bound on the space of continuous classes used in the Selmer-group dimension estimates, via [`groupCohomology.finrank_continuousClasses_le_invariants_add_dualTwist`](thm.html#groupCohomology.finrank_continuousClasses_le_invariants_add_dualTwist).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_groupCohomology_finrank_inflationImage_le_finrank_invariants_add_finrank_invariants_dualTwist.lean

